[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15543.79, "timestamp": "04:19:03", "text": "好的，哦，如果没有人喊叫，那就两红。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15548.149, "timestamp": "04:19:08", "text": "还有L，或者哦，序列号是多少？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15552.469, "timestamp": "04:19:12", "text": "最后一次挖掘究竟有多少次，确实很奇怪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15555.83, "timestamp": "04:19:15", "text": "好的，所以没有黄色电线。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15559.469, "timestamp": "04:19:19", "text": "对，没有黄色电线，所以剪掉第三根。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15563.109, "timestamp": "04:19:23", "text": "第三根线，好的，完成了，绿色"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15567.349, "timestamp": "04:19:27", "text": "灯光哦，不错，最后一个按钮我们仍然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15569.87, "timestamp": "04:19:29", "text": "有两分半钟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15574.75, "timestamp": "04:19:34", "text": "哦，不错，呃，呃，短信里说了什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15577.79, "timestamp": "04:19:37", "text": "还有那个大按钮"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15583.51, "timestamp": "04:19:43", "text": "哎呀，那是个蓝色的按钮，上面写着“中止 B”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15587.83, "timestamp": "04:19:47", "text": "嗯，是的，按钮上写着是蓝色的按钮"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15591.269, "timestamp": "04:19:51", "text": "比如说 B 按住按钮，或者哦，按住"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15596.51, "timestamp": "04:19:56", "text": "按住按钮，按住它，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15599.99, "timestamp": "04:19:59", "text": "拿着它，呃，蓝色，蓝色释放"}]